      "text": "Everything runs in one Python process per command; no daemon, no database server.\nEnv: DATACOPILOT_ENV, LOG_LEVEL, MAX_TABLE_*, WORKERS, CACHE_DIR, HASH_CACHE, ALLOWED_LICENSES, CACHE_KEY (built); HF token (planned, env only, never logged).",
